{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Training Error.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Training Error.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"training error training error","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Training Error.md","fileName":"Training Error.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Training Error","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 20:21\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Statistical Learning and Validation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Statistical Learning and Validation","Training Dataset","dataanalysisforthelifescienceswithr.pdf","essentialsofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Training Error.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Training Error.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"training error training error","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Training Error.md","fileName":"Training Error.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Training Error","heading":"Training Error","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Training error measures prediction mistakes on the same observations used to fit a model. It describes how closely the learned rule conforms to its [[Training Dataset]] but usually understates error on new data.\n\nA more flexible method can lower training error even after generalization begins to worsen. The source's one-neighbor classifier reaches zero training error by matching every point to itself, providing an extreme example of why training fit cannot select a model alone.\n\nIn the book's examples, very strong or perfect training results are treated as a warning rather than proof of success. Validation error reveals whether added complexity is learning transferable structure or merely reproducing the training partition.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Statistical Learning and Validation","Training Dataset","dataanalysisforthelifesciences